#. module: bf_federation_outreach
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_federation_outreach.view_federation_outreach_report_form
msgid ""
". It is read-only here and refreshes daily. To keep a target from being "
"contacted, open it and use <strong>Set aside</strong>: the agency will "
"receive it."
msgstr ""
".\n"
"                    Il se lit ici et se rafraîchit chaque jour. Pour qu'une cible ne soit pas contactée,\n"
"                    ouvrez-la et utilisez <strong>Écarter</strong> : l'agence le recevra."

#. module: bf_federation_outreach
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_outreach/models/outreach_report.py:0
msgid ": %s"
msgstr " : %s"

#. module: bf_federation_outreach
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_outreach/models/outreach_report.py:0
msgid ""
"<p>At %s, the target <b>%s</b> was set aside: %s. It is now \"do not "
"contact\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Chez %s, la cible <b>%s</b> a été écartée : %s. Elle est passée à « ne "
"pas contacter ».</p>"

#. module: bf_federation_outreach
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_outreach/models/outreach_report.py:0
msgid ""
"<p>Prospecting report received from %s: <b>%s</b>, %s target(s). It is read-"
"only here; to set a target aside, open it and use <b>Set aside</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Suivi de démarchage reçu de %s : <b>%s</b>, %s cible(s). Il se lit ici ; "
"pour écarter une cible, ouvrez-la et utilisez <b>Écarter</b>.</p>"

#. module: bf_federation_outreach
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_outreach/models/outreach_report.py:0
msgid "A target can only be set aside in a report received from an agency."
msgstr "On n'écarte une cible que dans un suivi reçu d'une agence."

