#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_outreach.field_federation_outreach_report__include_contacts
msgid ""
"By default, only the targeted company crosses over, with its stage and dated"
" touches. Tick to also send the contact person's name, job title, contact "
"details and touch summaries: reserve this for a mandate where the client is "
"responsible for that information."
